# 必考词 Unit 29 短语

## 常考短语

- **confirm sb in**: 使某人确信 — The results confirmed her in her belief. 结果使她更加确信自己的信念。
- **as a consequence of**: 由于 — As a consequence of the war, many people lost their homes. 由于战争，许多人失去了家园。
- **take...into consideration**: 考虑到 — We must take all factors into consideration. 我们必须考虑所有因素。
- **constitute a threat**: 构成威胁 — Climate change constitutes a major threat. 气候变化构成了重大威胁。
- **consume energy**: 消耗能源 — Old buildings consume more energy. 旧建筑消耗更多能源。
- **be contemporary with**: 与…同时代 — He was contemporary with Shakespeare. 他与莎士比亚同时代。
- **contribute to**: 有助于 — Regular exercise contributes to good health. 定期锻炼有助于健康。
- **convert...into**: 把…转换为 — Solar panels convert sunlight into electricity. 太阳能板将阳光转换为电能。
- **convince sb to do sth**: 说服某人做某事 — She convinced him to change his mind. 她说服他改变了主意。
- **cooperate with**: 与…合作 — The police asked the public to cooperate with the investigation. 警方要求公众配合调查。
- **correspond to**: 与…对应 — The American Congress corresponds to the British Parliament. 美国国会相当于英国议会。
- **on the decline**: 在下降中 — Traditional industries are on the decline. 传统行业正在衰退。
- **define...as**: 把…定义为 — We can define intelligence as the ability to learn. 我们可以把智力定义为学习的能力。
- **deprive sb of sth**: 剥夺某人某物 — The court deprived him of his rights. 法院剥夺了他的权利。
- **devote...to**: 把…奉献给 — She devoted her life to medical research. 她把一生奉献给了医学研究。
